---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import clinica from '../../data/clinica.json';

const titular = clinica.razon_social || clinica.nombre;
const nif = clinica.nif || 'to be completed';
const direccion = `${clinica.direccion.calle}, ${clinica.direccion.codigo_postal} ${clinica.direccion.ciudad}`;
---
<Base
  titulo="Privacy Policy | Doria Clinic"
  descripcion="How Doria Clinic handles the personal data of visitors to this website and of people who contact us by WhatsApp, phone or email."
  h1="Privacy policy"
  anchoCompleto
>
  <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Owner: {titular} (trading as «{clinica.nombre}»)</li>
    <li>Tax ID (NIF): {nif}</li>
    <li>Address: {direccion}</li>
    <li>Email: {clinica.email}</li>
    <li>Phone: {clinica.telefono}</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How we handle your data on this website</h2>
  <p>
    This is a static, informational website: it does not include its own data
    collection forms or a patient database. When you contact us through the
    WhatsApp, call or email buttons shown on the site, the communication takes
    place directly between you and {clinica.nombre} through the application or
    service you choose, and no data is recorded on this website.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Patient data</h2>
  <p>
    Health data you provide when booking an appointment or during your visit to
    the clinic is processed in accordance with data protection regulations and
    applicable healthcare regulations (including Spanish Law 41/2002, on patient
    autonomy), and is managed separately from this website, within the clinic's
    own systems.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Purpose and legal basis</h2>
  <p>
    When you write to us by WhatsApp, email or phone, we process the data you
    provide (name, phone number, reason for enquiry) in order to respond to your
    request and, where applicable, manage your appointment. The legal basis for
    this processing is your own consent, given by initiating contact yourself.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Recipients</h2>
  <p>
    We do not share your data with third parties, except where legally required.
    If you write to us via WhatsApp, please note that Meta Platforms Ireland Ltd.,
    as the service provider, processes the communication's metadata in accordance
    with its own privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You may exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection,
    restriction of processing and portability by writing to{' '}
    <a href={'mailto:' + clinica.email}>{clinica.email}</a> or by post to{' '}
    {direccion}, enclosing a copy of a document proving your identity. You may
    also lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD)
    (<a href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aepd.es</a>) if
    you believe we have not properly handled your request.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    We only keep the data from the communications you send us for as long as
    necessary to handle your enquiry, unless the relationship leads to clinical
    care, in which case the retention periods for medical records set by
    healthcare legislation apply.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This website uses first-party and third-party cookies. You can find the
    details in our <a href="/en/politica-cookies/">cookie policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this privacy policy to reflect legislative developments or
    changes to the website. We recommend reviewing it periodically.
  </p>

  <p><em>Last updated: September 2026.</em></p>
</Base>
